  "description": "The PDF half of the C# indra-ocr port's document.convert: it rasterises PDF pages and\nreads their text layer through PDFium, handing Indra.Ocr.Core grayscale pixels (PDFium renders\nstraight to 8-bit gray). PDFium itself comes from the native bblanchon.PDFium.* packages, which this\npackage depends on; this package binds it directly and ships no native binary of its own.",
